.SH "نام (NAME)"
polkitd.conf \- The polkit system daemon configuration file
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBpolkitd\&.conf\fR
file is the configuration file for the
\fBpolkitd\fR
system daemon\&. The configuration format is INI style, with sections and key=value pairs\&.
.PP
The configuration file located at
/etc/polkit\-1/polkitd\&.conf
has the highest precedence, if found\&. If not,
/run/polkit\-1/polkitd\&.conf
will be used\&. If neither file is found,
/usr/lib/polkit\-1/polkitd\&.conf
will be used\&. If no configuration file is found, default settings compiled into
\fBpolkitd\fR
will be used\&.
.SH "[POLKITD] SECTION"
.PP
The
[Polkitd]
section accepts the following keys\&.
.SS "ExpirationSeconds="
.PP
Specifies the default expiration time, in seconds, for temporary authorizations granted by
\fBpolkitd\fR
via interactive authentication\&. The default value is 300 (5 minutes)\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBpolkitd\fR(8),
\fBpolkit\fR(8),
